     SHORT="A simple serial device I/O tool"

cat << EOF
tio is a serial device tool with a straightforward command-line and
configuration file interface. You can use it to connect to serial TTY
devices for basic I/O operations. It is a simple alternative to classic
terminal programs such as minicom or screen. It supports features such
as automatic reconnection, logging, timestamps, hex mode, local echo,
mapping of input and output characters, and Lua scripting.
EOF
